# Generated report-card artifacts.
#
# Rendered report cards (self-contained HTML with inline SVG/base64 plots) and
# the pinned reference fixtures are *generated* deliverables — regenerated from
# the pin scripts + render CLIs, not hand-edited. They are committed so the
# cards are shareable, but they dominate the diff (two cards are ~52k lines
# each). Mark them generated + non-diffable so GitHub collapses them in review
# and excludes them from language stats; the code + pin scripts are what gets
# reviewed.

docs/report_cards/**/*.html            linguist-generated=true -diff
tests/fixtures/population_phenotype_basal_reference.json  linguist-generated=true -diff
docs/report_cards/**/vecoli_reference.json               linguist-generated=true -diff
docs/report_cards/**/literature_reference.json           linguist-generated=true -diff
# Golden model fixtures (committed sim snapshots). Glob covers all of them at the
# tests/fixtures home; the small `provenance` block they carry is the only
# hand-meaningful part, so this collapses the bulk (per-cell arrays) in review.
tests/fixtures/**/model_*.json                           linguist-generated=true -diff
